---
inbox: feedback@example.com
subject: New feedback
reply-to: from
sample:
  note: The map is slow on mobile.
  from: host@example.com
  page: https://example.com/activities/kayak
---
{{!--
  A letter that comes to us rather than going out, so it names the inbox it lands in and no
  caller has to address it. Its subject is a line of text rather than a copy key, because
  nobody at Acme needs it in four languages.
--}}
{{#> layout heading="New feedback" closing="Sent from the feedback form." }}
  <tr>
    <td style="padding: 20px 32px 0; font-size: 15px; color: #121825">{{ note }}</td>
  </tr>
  <tr>
    <td style="padding: 12px 32px 0; font-size: 13px; color: #596579">
      {{ from }} &middot; {{ page }}
    </td>
  </tr>
{{/layout}}
